INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'044ad013-06d4-4d70-bb78-088ad9b46fa9', N'4151818e-de4c-4774-bd55-b8900ff33d42', N'What is the role of the ''Serialization'' layer in Litestar''s performance architecture?', N'Senior', N'The serialization layer allows for fine-grained control over how objects are converted to JSON, supporting various codecs and custom encoders. By optimizing how data is marshaled, Litestar reduces CPU cycles spent on object inspection, which is critical for high-frequency API endpoints.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
