INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'd23bba81-545b-4ff0-a2d6-417642d8c60e', N'9392e17b-213b-4c58-8a72-3d143d85e23b', N'What is the main advantage of using Redis over a file-based cache?', N'Junior', N'Redis provides much faster access speeds because it resides in RAM, whereas file-based caches require disk I/O. Redis also provides built-in features for data expiration, atomic operations, and distributed access, which are not available in simple file-based systems.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6ec1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
