INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'351eeb28-e216-4140-a418-449c3a9656e9', N'abbea783-abdd-4b9e-893f-9087683f97bb', N'Discuss the trade-offs of using Redis as a cache store versus a primary data store in Rails.', N'Senior', N'Redis is excellent as a cache due to its high-speed in-memory access and expiration features. Using it as a primary store requires careful management of data persistence and memory limits, as it lacks the complex query capabilities and relational integrity features of traditional RDBMS.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
