INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'3108b1ae-65f5-46e2-b9a2-56bce6553a3c', N'b903153c-4b94-4387-ad3d-450649fa0c50', N'What is a Parameter in the Symfony Service Container?', N'Fresher', N'A parameter is a static configuration value, such as a database host or a file path, stored in the container. Unlike services, parameters are not objects but simple values used to configure the behavior of services.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
