INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'5744b432-8a98-4de3-9c17-9690ec4dc8a0', N'368072d9-3146-42c7-8f59-b4bf61b3cc3f', N'What is the purpose of @Transactional?', N'Junior', N'This annotation ensures that a set of database operations succeeds or fails as a single unit of work. If any operation within the method fails, the entire transaction is rolled back, maintaining data integrity.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
