INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'b41c9583-9884-4602-b3dd-acb53b9d531a', N'1ad89512-2f43-42c9-af01-2f95e211d5dd', N'What is the difference between ''managed = True'' and ''managed = False'' in a model?', N'Intern', N'When managed is set to True, Django manages the creation and deletion of database tables for that model. When set to False, Django ignores the model during database migrations, meaning you manage the table manually.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
