INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'd64aaf24-4083-411c-b153-e25fe49d1c95', N'55404b9c-91b6-4b62-9dc7-63248e8ea1df', N'Compare horizontal and vertical scaling in the context of stateful vs. stateless services.', N'Senior', N'Stateless services scale horizontally easily by adding more instances behind a load balancer, as they share no local state. Stateful services are significantly harder to scale horizontally because they require data synchronization or complex partitioning strategies across the cluster.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'71c1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
