INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'b0813a00-acee-4d24-8dd4-eb91ac6fa987', N'0a728321-c234-4b3b-871d-eb8a37768d9f', N'What is the purpose of the ''forRoot'' pattern in NestJS modules?', N'Intern', N'The forRoot pattern is a common convention in NestJS modules that allows for dynamic configuration during module registration. It enables the passing of options to a module when it is imported, which are then used to configure its internal providers.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'6cc1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
