INSERT [dbo].[Questions] ([QuestionId], [CategoryId], [Question], [Difficulty], [Answer], [Status], [IsDeleted], [DeletedAt], [CreatedBy], [CreatedAt], [UpdatedAt], [DeletedBy], [PositionId]) VALUES (N'6fd2cd05-8447-4670-8823-f1539feb53a2', N'18ebabb7-555b-4ba1-beb6-844b8ee55dbd', N'What is the purpose of cache-aside ''TTL jitter''?', N'Senior', N'TTL jitter involves adding a small, random amount of time to the cache expiration duration. This prevents large batches of keys from expiring simultaneously, which would otherwise trigger a synchronized load spike on the backend database.', N'Active', 0, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.3860866' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2026-07-13T14:49:57.4119316' AS DateTime2), NULL, N'71c1cfe6-a888-f111-b9fd-d362599bedcb')
